   Sorry for the late reply. What you mention might be the issue, particularly the 100% recapture, although we found the same problem in an older version of BaSTA, particularly the version that is currently in CRAN. I can send you the updated version, but alternatively, I can send you another package I’ve developed based on BaSTA but that works on census data, which might be more appropriate in your case.

Best,

